---
layout: base.njk
title: restful | Peer-Angebote für Organisationen im Gesundheits- und Sozialwesen
description: restful baut mit Patientenorganisationen, Ligen und Fachverbänden Peer-Angebote auf und betreibt sie unter deren Namen. Kompetenzzentrum und Umsetzungspartnerin für Peer-Arbeit in der Schweiz.
scripts:
  - /js/journey.js
---
{% from "icon.njk" import icon %}

<section aria-labelledby="hero-titel" class="border-b border-line">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-content px-5 py-section-sm sm:px-8 md:py-section">
    <h1 id="hero-titel" class="max-w-3xl break-words text-h1 font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance md:text-display">Erfahrungswissen wirksam machen. Unter eurem Namen.</h1>
    <p class="mt-6 max-w-prose text-lead text-ink-soft">restful ist Kompetenzzentrum und Umsetzungspartnerin für Peer-Angebote im Schweizer Gesundheits- und Sozialwesen. Wir bauen mit euch Angebote auf, in denen Betroffene voneinander lernen, und betreiben sie mit euch weiter.</p>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-prose text-ink-soft">Weil Gleichbetroffene etwas wissen, das in keiner Sprechstunde Platz hat.</p>
    <a href="#kontakt" class="mt-10 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-accent px-6 py-3 font-medium text-paper hover:bg-accent-strong focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-accent">{{ journey.cta }} {{ icon("arrow", "size-5") }}</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="nutzen-titel">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-content px-5 py-section-sm sm:px-8 md:py-section">
    <h2 id="nutzen-titel" class="max-w-2xl text-h2 font-semibold tracking-tight">Warum sich ein Peer-Angebot für eure Organisation lohnt</h2>
    <ul class="mt-12 grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-3 md:gap-8">
      {% for item in nutzen %}
      <li>
        <span class="inline-flex size-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-accent-soft text-accent">{{ icon(item.icon) }}</span>
        <h3 class="mt-5 text-h3 font-semibold">{{ item.titel }}</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 max-w-prose text-ink-soft">{{ item.text }}</p>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="partner-banner-titel" class="border-y border-line bg-surface">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-content px-5 py-10 sm:px-8">
    <p id="partner-banner-titel" class="text-center text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-soft">Mit diesen Organisationen arbeiten wir zusammen</p>
    <ul class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-12 gap-y-6">
      {% for p in partnerlogos %}
      <li>
        <img src="/images/{{ p.logo }}" alt="{{ p.name }}" class="h-[68px] w-auto max-w-[238px] object-contain" loading="lazy">
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="unsicher-titel">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-content px-5 sm:px-8">
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface px-6 py-8 sm:px-10">
      <h2 id="unsicher-titel" class="text-h3 font-semibold">Noch unsicher, ob das zu euch passt?</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 max-w-prose text-ink-soft">Ein Gespräch klärt oft mehr als jede Broschüre. Oder ihr verschafft euch zuerst in unserer Webinar-Reihe einen Überblick.</p>
      <ul class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-x-8 gap-y-3">
        <li><a href="#kontakt" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-medium text-accent underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-accent-strong focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-accent">Unverbindlich sprechen {{ icon("arrow", "size-4") }}</a></li>
        <li><a href="#webinar" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-medium text-accent underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-accent-strong focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-accent">Zur Webinar-Reihe {{ icon("arrow", "size-4") }}</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="journey-titel" id="journey">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-content px-5 py-section-sm sm:px-8 md:py-section">
    <h2 id="journey-titel" class="text-h2 font-semibold tracking-tight">{{ journey.titel }}</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-prose text-ink-soft">{{ journey.intro }}</p>

    <ol class="mt-10 grid gap-4" data-journey>
      {% for station in journey.stationen %}
      <li class="rounded-2xl border border-line bg-paper">
        <h3 class="text-h3">
          <button type="button" id="{{ station.id }}-knopf" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="{{ station.id }}" data-journey-button class="group flex w-full items-center gap-5 rounded-2xl px-5 py-5 text-left hover:bg-surface focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent sm:px-8 sm:py-6">
            <span class="inline-flex size-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-accent text-base font-semibold text-accent group-aria-expanded:bg-accent group-aria-expanded:text-paper">{{ station.nummer }}</span>
            <span class="grid flex-1 gap-1">
              <span class="font-semibold">{{ station.titel }}</span>
              <span class="text-base font-normal text-ink-soft">{{ station.kurz }}</span>
            </span>
            {{ icon("chevron-down", "size-6 shrink-0 text-ink-soft transition-transform duration-300 motion-reduce:transition-none group-aria-expanded:rotate-180") }}
          </button>
        </h3>
        <div id="{{ station.id }}" role="region" aria-labelledby="{{ station.id }}-knopf" data-journey-panel data-open="true" class="grid grid-rows-[1fr] transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-300 ease-out motion-reduce:transition-none data-[open=false]:grid-rows-[0fr]">
          <div class="overflow-hidden">
            <div class="border-t border-line px-5 pb-8 pt-6 sm:px-8">
              <p class="max-w-prose">{{ station.intro }}</p>
              <div class="mt-8 grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-2">
                <div>
                  <h4 class="font-semibold">Was wir konkret tun</h4>
                  <ul class="mt-4 grid gap-3">
                    {% for punkt in station.angebot %}
                    <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-1 text-accent">{{ icon("check", "size-5") }}</span><span>{{ punkt }}</span></li>
                    {% endfor %}
                  </ul>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <h4 class="font-semibold">Wie ein Projekt abläuft</h4>
                  <ol class="mt-4 grid gap-4">
                    {% for schritt in station.ablauf %}
                    <li class="grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-x-3">
                      <span class="text-sm font-semibold leading-7 text-accent">{{ loop.index }}</span>
                      <span><span class="font-medium">{{ schritt.schritt }}</span><br><span class="text-ink-soft">{{ schritt.text }}</span></span>
                    </li>
                    {% endfor %}
                  </ol>
                </div>
              </div>
              <a href="#kontakt" class="mt-10 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-accent px-6 py-3 font-medium text-paper hover:bg-accent-strong focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-accent">{{ journey.cta }} {{ icon("arrow", "size-5") }}</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="settings-titel" class="border-y border-line bg-surface">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-content px-5 py-section-sm sm:px-8 md:py-section">
    <h2 id="settings-titel" class="text-h2 font-semibold tracking-tight">Wo Peer-Arbeit wirkt</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-prose text-ink-soft">{{ settings.intro }}</p>
    <ul class="mt-10 grid gap-x-8 gap-y-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      {% for feld in settings.felder %}
      <li class="border-t border-line pt-5">
        <h3 class="font-semibold">{{ feld.titel }}</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-ink-soft">{{ feld.text }}</p>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="vertrauen-titel">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-content px-5 py-section-sm sm:px-8 md:py-section">
    <h2 id="vertrauen-titel" class="max-w-2xl text-h2 font-semibold tracking-tight">Wissenschaftlich fundiert, sicher und vertraulich</h2>
    <ul class="mt-12 grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-3 md:gap-8">
      {% for item in vertrauen %}
      <li>
        <span class="inline-flex size-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-accent-soft text-accent">{{ icon(item.icon) }}</span>
        <h3 class="mt-5 text-h3 font-semibold">{{ item.titel }}</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 max-w-prose text-ink-soft">{{ item.text }}</p>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
    <a href="/wissenschaft/" class="mt-10 inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-medium text-accent underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-accent-strong focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-accent">Mehr zu Evidenz und Forschung {{ icon("arrow", "size-4") }}</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="communities-titel" id="communities" class="scroll-mt-8 border-t border-line">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-content px-5 py-section-sm sm:px-8 md:py-section">
    <h2 id="communities-titel" class="text-h2 font-semibold tracking-tight">Diese Organisationen arbeiten mit uns</h2>
    <ul class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4">
      {% for i in initiatives %}
      <li class="flex h-28 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-line bg-paper p-5">
        <a href="{{ i.href }}" class="flex size-full items-center justify-center rounded focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-accent">
          <img src="/images/{{ i.logo }}" alt="{{ i.name }}" class="max-h-14 w-auto max-w-full object-contain" loading="lazy">
        </a>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="projekte-titel" class="border-t border-line">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-content px-5 py-section-sm sm:px-8 md:py-section">
    <h2 id="projekte-titel" class="text-h2 font-semibold tracking-tight">Patientenpfade digital denken</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-prose text-ink-soft">Manche Vorhaben brauchen eine eigene Lösung. Wir entwickeln digitale und hybride Angebote, die dort ansetzen, wo Menschen im Versorgungsverlauf stehen, von der Konzeption bis zum Betrieb.</p>
    <a href="/projekte/" class="mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-medium text-accent underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-accent-strong focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-accent">Individuelle Projekte ansehen {{ icon("arrow", "size-4") }}</a>
  </div>
</section>
